{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:095af0319477a17211c13c199df1bb7cf94bf008426b3c88d196c68b757f6dab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1b26bd5c92a44ccc73a2f6710c888e04b746174483db6b045d7f64679e05d4",
      "text": "Sing a song for",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cdcfce3c033f6ee734a55daee616851146b562d69d675763b5b5a192b97783d",
      "text": "男极‘制作部门’正式确定举办，\nDRAMATIC STARS将负责把素人制作成\n偶像。而他们要负责的，\n是一位性格有点要强的老爷爷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000008:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000008:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1b26bd5c92a44ccc73a2f6710c888e04b746174483db6b045d7f64679e05d4",
      "text": "Sing a song for",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ec3389077892bb515fbb36f84c1ee7da8964be97c706201152a066ddaf1a27",
      "text": "哎呀，男极‘速度部门’虽然\n发生了点小插曲，但办得非常成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:709a40fd72a921bd48efda2f85074ccea539e1db194dec43978b405a76f5a334",
      "text": "包括315 Pro在内的小事务所展现出的\n热血羁绊，在节目播出后引发了广泛话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13650ce640b585b62f9afa175d0e83b596462a1819e1be7b2a1082e6b0cc121c",
      "text": "啊。说到315 Pro，‘受欢迎部门’里\nJupiter出演的那期！收视率也相当不错……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a0ddac7ccd82cbe5de6d9770b6ef6a864dd6d75bc7175f6d274665eaf200f92",
      "text": "（这群新面孔事务所。把我的大赛搅得一团乱！\n要是再这样下去……不，等等）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13ccd3bec2d55b970fe3299ce4a70568e3085c0b1ccc69444a4fc6e2b254b67e",
      "text": "（听说315 Pro的偶像们，原本很多人是医生或者律师，\n跟偶像界毫无交集）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e99c86fd44a9b7b70e30ba0ec0c93056d064e0b89928d6cec8ad1079257a3611",
      "text": "（也就是说……他们对偶像的相关知识，根本就如同门外汉！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94ff57e77286a503d121125c35284e738553e08e2363f32c7d7a8abe448b0901",
      "text": "（至今为止的表现，绝对是因为有制作人和\n事务所工作人员的辅助！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3740b30db81cf40efad25f8ff7226b41406479be0720805b827011da8ea663",
      "text": "（既然如此，要是让偶像自己去\n‘制作偶像’的话……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:867648cdef302886c4de6c26e8945fd7c8077ecc84588e8e2cc9b5694eba1f4a",
      "text": "咳咳。各位，关于下一个主题……。\n男极‘制作部门’怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a6eda574ca322b5a678424f1831cd2952c50a81a0071d1646d702fddf6b079d",
      "text": "让偶像把普通人变身为偶像！\n……听起来不是很有趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
